{#
  Reusable photo carousel — promised to Shanelle at the 2026-07-31 working session.

  Include it with a caller-supplied heading, blurb and image list:

    {% with carousel_id="community", carousel_title="Our community",
            carousel_blurb="Moments from Legacy events.", carousel_images=gallery %}
      {% include "_carousel.html.j2" %}
    {% endwith %}

  Design notes, so the next person does not undo them:
  - Scrolling is native CSS scroll-snap, so the carousel works with JavaScript off or
    still loading. The buttons and dots are enhancement, not the mechanism.
  - It is a labelled region with real <button>s, not clickable divs. Screen reader and
    keyboard users get the same affordance as a mouse.
  - No autoplay. This audience is often reading one-handed beside someone they care for;
    motion that moves on its own is hostile to that, and it fails WCAG 2.2.2 besides.
  - Images are lazy and carry width/height so the page does not jump as they arrive.
#}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="{{ carousel_id }}-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="{{ carousel_id }}-heading">{{ carousel_title }}</h2>
    {%- if carousel_blurb %}
    <p class="muted">{{ carousel_blurb }}</p>
    {%- endif %}

    <div class="carousel" data-carousel id="{{ carousel_id }}">
      <button class="carousel-nav carousel-prev" type="button"
              aria-label="Previous photos" data-carousel-prev hidden>&#8592;</button>

      <ul class="carousel-track" data-carousel-track
          tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="{{ carousel_title }} photo carousel">
        {%- for img in carousel_images %}
        <li class="carousel-item">
          <img src="{{ img.src }}" alt="{{ img.alt }}"
               loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="600">
          {%- if img.caption %}
          <p class="carousel-caption">{{ img.caption }}</p>
          {%- endif %}
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>

      <button class="carousel-nav carousel-next" type="button"
              aria-label="More photos" data-carousel-next hidden>&#8594;</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
